        <briefdescription>
<para>Select a <ref refid="d4/de1/classorg_1_1xvm_1_1asm_1_1_version" kindref="compound">Version</ref> of a Module to use. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>An implementation may choose to throw an Exception or return <computeroutput>null</computeroutput> to indicate that none of the available Module Versions is acceptable, which will kill the linking process.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>module</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>the identifier of the Module (never null) </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>versions</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>the available Module Versions that do not conflict with previously discovered <ref refid="d4/de1/classorg_1_1xvm_1_1asm_1_1_version" kindref="compound">Version</ref> constraints (never null, never empty) </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>prefs</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>a list of preferred versions (never null, may be empty)</para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>the <ref refid="d4/de1/classorg_1_1xvm_1_1asm_1_1_version" kindref="compound">Version</ref> of the Module to use </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
