    <briefdescription>
<para>A Module <ref refid="d9/d62/classorg_1_1xvm_1_1javajit_1_1_refiner" kindref="compound">Refiner</ref> is the &quot;decision maker&quot; for selecting among various version, dependency, and conditional-define options for Module(s) being fed to a <ref refid="df/dab/classorg_1_1xvm_1_1javajit_1_1_linker" kindref="compound">Linker</ref>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class can be extended to provide customized refinement decisions for <ref refid="d9/d60/classorg_1_1xvm_1_1javajit_1_1_type_system" kindref="compound">TypeSystem</ref> linking. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
